1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,040
M: Aren't you supposed to be in Boston right now?

2
00:00:02,535 --> 00:00:04,900
I thought you left to attend the business conference yesterday?

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,840
W: I did, and I came back late last night.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:14,200
It was only a day affair, and I took the last flight out because I have a meeting with Mr. Jones this afternoon.

5
00:00:14,915 --> 00:00:20,200
I could have taken a flight out this morning, but I have some things to prepare before I meet with him.

6
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:25,550
M: You know, if I had known that it was only a day affair, I would have taken the trip with you.

7
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:30,450
I also have a meeting with a very important client today, and that's why I didn't make the trip.

8
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:32,690
W: You should've talked to me about it.

9
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,270
We could've made the trip together.
